{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39818","headline":"观贺皇太子册命 · 殷文圭","name":"观贺皇太子册命","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嗣册储皇帝命行，万方臣妾跃欢声。\n鸾旃再立星辰正，雉扇双开日月明。\n自有汉元争翊戴，不劳商皓定欹倾。\n春宫保傅皆周召，致主何忧不太平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷文圭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39818.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39818","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}